          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/text/Spanned#SPAN_EXCLUSIVE_EXCLUSIVE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.text.Spanned.SPAN_EXCLUSIVE_EXCLUSIVE</code>.</a></format></para>
